  "summary": "Ghost 6.14.0 before 6.27.0 Path Traversal via ImageSize",
  "details": "Ghost versions 6.14.0 through versions prior to 6.27.0 contain a path traversal vulnerability in the ImageSize service. Insufficient input validation of user-supplied file paths may allow authenticated staff users to access local files outside the intended data storage directories on the server.",
